# Add suppression patterns here, one per line.
# See https://clang.llvm.org/docs/ThreadSanitizer.html#suppressing-reports
# for the ThreadSanitizer suppression file format.
#
# ThreadSanitizer only reads one suppressions file.  The testsuite
# (gdb/testsuite/lib/gdb.exp) only falls back to gdb/tsan-suppressions.txt
# when TSAN_OPTIONS has no suppressions= entry, so when test_rocgdb.py
# passes this file, gdb/tsan-suppressions.txt is not read.  Keep the entries
# of gdb/tsan-suppressions.txt in here too.

# Problem in ncurses, see:
# - https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=29328.
# - https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-ncurses/2022-07/msg00002.html
